    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPrime Investment Opportunity Two Self Contained Town Centre Units\n\nExcellent investment opportunity to acquire two self contained residential units, being offered for sale in one lot, in a highly sought after Town Centre location.\n\nThe property comprises two spacious, independently accessed apartments, offering excellent potential for rental income and future investment growth.\n\nGround Floor Unit 81 sq. m.\n• 2 bedrooms\n• Master bedroom with ensuite\n• Main bathroom\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Open plan living/dining area\n• Own private entrance\n\nFirst Floor Unit 87 sq. m.\n• 2 bedrooms\n• Master bedroom with ensuite\n• Main bathroom\n• Kitchen\n• Open plan living/dining area\n• Own private entrance\n\nBoth units were renovated and refurbished approximately 20 years ago and would now benefit from some cosmetic upgrading, including redecoration and general modernisation. Both units benefit from all mains services and electric storage heating.\nIdeally positioned just a stone's throw from Wexford's main shopping thoroughfare, the property is within easy walking distance of a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, services and other Town Centre amenities.\n\nWith strong demand for rental accommodation in the current market, this property offers an attractive opportunity for an investor seeking to acquire two separate residential units in a single purchase.\n\nAn excellent investment with significant rental potential and scope to add value through cosmetic refurbishment. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\n21A Ground Floor Apartment - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 6.32m x 1m\nWith doors to\n\nKitchen - 4.15 x 3.05\nFitted kitchen units with ample storage. Open to Living / Dining area.\n\nLiving Room - 6.53 x 3.97\nWith door to rear yard.\n\nBathroom - 3.85 x 2.08\nWith bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.19 x 2.82\nDoor to ensuite shower room.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.85 x 1.35\nWith shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.36 x 2.88\n\n\n21B First Floor Apartment - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.97 x 2.67\nWith doors to\n\nKitchen - 4.31 x 2.62\nFitted kitchen units with ample storage. Open to Living/Dining area.\n\nLiving Room - 6.65 x 4.08\nWith door to rear.\n\nBathroom - 2.08 x 1.89\nWith bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.75 x 3.65\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.15 x 3.65\nWith door to ensuite.\n\nEn-Suite - 3.07 x 1.05\nWith shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nOutside - \nLarge communal yard.\n\nServices - \nAll mains and electric heating.\n\n"
